    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0001",
      "source": "If [`rtol`](sparsegmresoptions/rtol.md) `= 0`, the operation uses the default value of `sqrt(epsilon)`.",
      "ko": "Devices that don’t support constituent device switching return [`AVCapturePrimaryConstituentDeviceRestrictedSwitchingBehaviorConditionNone`](avcaptureprimaryconstituentdevicerestrictedswitchingbehaviorconditions/avcaptureprimaryconstituentdevicerestrictedswitchingbehaviorconditionnone.md).",
      "sourceHash": "d17d725f3f08bfce4938b8253365eec1d283593974425056b4192f171ee88403",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0001",
      "source": "If it’s negative, the system treats [`rtol`](sparsegmresoptions/rtol.md) as `0.0` (it doesn’t use the default).",
      "ko": "이 속성은 키-값 관찰이 가능합니다.",
